(text "Notes" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 636.27 176.022 0) (effects (font (size 2 2) (thickness 0.4) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "073b8ddd-bc48-460b-be20-8fa098aa6873"))
(text "Bank TPS48100 VBAT_P -> VBAT_SLOTS: 5 mOhm + 61.9k = SCP 21.2/28.6/36.3 A, 68\nnF + 100k latch-off 466-1490 us (>100x the 1-4.5 us slot eFuse trip). Hardware\noverload cutoff: INA281A2 -> 15.8k / 2x 10 uF -> TLV3012B -> 74LVC1G74 latch\n-> AO3400A pulls U110 UVLO low; trip 3.15-3.76 A HOT (default; R773 10k holds\nP13 low at reset) or 5.11-6.08 A ROOM (TS5A3166 adds 25.5k, 0x22 P13); clear\nby toggling BANK_EN. U112 TS5A3166 is an 185 F (85 C) part: keep it >= 15 mm\nfrom R760/Q106/Q107/U110.\nEach slot (Pass 5): TPS16630 eFuse, no per-slot blade fuse. ILIM 3.09k = I_OL\n5.36-6.30 A (Pass 6 M2; was 4.02k), fast trip 2x I_OL, hard short 45 A / 1 us,\nMODE open = latch (reset by SHDN#). OVP 453k/10k: off 53.4-57.8 V. UVLO\n100k/27k/4.7 nF. dVdT 10 nF (32 V in 5-8.4 ms). IMON 15k test point. 10k pull-\ndown on SHDN# (PWR_EN). 2.2 uF / 100 V at IN, SS310B OUT -> GND at the pins.\nBank VS hold-up (Pass 4): VBAT_P -> 1N4148W -> 100R -> VS, 1 uF / 100 V.\nBank gate network: 470R G1PU; 0R G1PD (fitted); 2.2 nF C1 diode-steered\n(1N4148W + 10R, 1M bleed to SRC); 1N4148W gate -> BST clamp; BZT52C15 K =\ngate, A = source; C_BST 2.2 uF / 50 V. UVLO nodes 4.7 nF; 100 nF / 100 V on\nVBAT_SLOTS and every SLn_VBAT. TPS2553 210k; its FAULT, eFuse FLT# and eFuse\nPGOOD are wired-OR onto SLn_PWR_FAULT_N.\nPWR_EN = NOT EN_N AND NOT PRESENT_N (1G02); OUT_EN_N = NAND(PWR_EN,\nGLOBAL_OUT_ALLOW, NOT ARM_N) (1G04 + 1G10). +3V3_ID via 68R 1206. Math:\nMODULAR_ARCHITECTURE sections 15-17, docs/modular/pass3_calc.txt,\npass4_calc.txt, pass5_calc.txt, kick_calc.txt." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 637.54 180.34 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "0e01ce92-df96-457d-85b3-e2906b483ef9"))
